                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-indent:37px;text-align:center;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:黑体">绍兴一中</span><span style="font-family:黑体">2022年校园文化艺术节活动方案</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-indent:37px;text-align:center;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px"> </span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">一、指导思想：</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-indent:32px;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">通过举办本届艺术节，展现我校素质教育的特质和我校素质教育的成果，深化教育教学改革，进一步丰富学生课外艺术活动的形式和内容，使学校艺术教育工作在全面推进素质教育的进程中科学、健康、持续、快速发展。面向全体学生，立足于提高审美修养和人文素养，促进德智体美劳全面发展，展现学生朝气蓬勃、昂扬向上的精神风貌。营造健康高雅的校园文化环境，体现向真、向善、向美、向上的校园文化特质。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-indent:32px;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">二、活动主题与内容</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-indent:32px;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">艺术节主题</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">博闻求真</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">·雅韵尚美</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">”。高一、高二各班围绕艺术节的主题，开展丰富多彩的适合学生个性发展，展示艺术才华的艺术活动，结合爱国、爱校、爱家、爱学习、爱生活，创作一批具有浓郁民族特色，表现广大中学生情趣的作品。作品要求做到思想性和艺术性的统一，具有创新性，体现时代特征、校园特色、学生特点。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-indent:32px;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-weight: bold;font-size: 16px">三、</span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">主要活动安排：</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> </span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（一）绍兴一中</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">2022年校园文化艺术节开幕式（暨校园十佳歌手比赛）。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">校园十佳歌手比赛以学生个人自愿报名为主，原则上各班不超过一个学生，并经过初选入围决赛。报名截止时间：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">11月16日中午。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">预赛时间：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">11月18日中午12：30 ,亚泉楼5011（音乐教室）</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">决赛时间：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">11月26日下午14：30正式开始。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">地点：图书馆三楼报告厅一</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（二）</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 9px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">    </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“欢乐青春”（原创）课本剧、小品、曲艺、器乐类比赛。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛说明：课本剧、舞台剧、小品要求录音，服装、道具自行准备，时间严格控制在</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">8分钟之内。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（三）</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“青春与梦想”歌曲、舞蹈比赛</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛说明：表演形式以群舞为主</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">,人数不得少于8人。服装、配乐、道具等自行准备。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">活动安排中（二）、（三）项，要求以班级为单位，各班必须选送一个节目参加比赛，同时保证节目质量。</span></span><strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">本次初赛不再组织现场评比，要求各班递交完整的节目视频，于</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">12月2日放学前上传到公共文件夹/德育处/2022校园文化艺术节，并要求以班级+类别+节目名称来命名。</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-indent:32px;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px"> </span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（四）新时代校园原创歌曲大赛</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">作品内容：积极、健康、向上，展示青春风采，传承中华美德，弘扬中国精神，树立良好的校风、学风等。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">1投稿方式</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">1）作品分为两种类型：原曲填词、全原创歌曲</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">2）高一、高二 每班必须上交1-2个作品，两种类型均可，风格不限</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">3）整首歌音频、完整词曲、歌曲海报上交至公共文件夹德育处/2022校园艺术节/新时代歌曲原创大赛，有条件者可附带上交MV等。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">4</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">）</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">自行截取</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">40s以内的出彩部分，同时上交至公共文件夹德育处/2022校园艺术节/新时代歌曲原创大赛，以作为大众公投材料</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">5</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">）</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">截止日期：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">11</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">30</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">日</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">2、评选方式</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">第一次评选：大众公投</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">(1) 高一高二每班派3名代表参与投票，合唱社全体成员作为项目发起人同时参与投票，不占用班级代表名额。班级代表名单各班上交至同时上交至公共文件夹德育处/2021校园艺术节/新时代歌曲原创大赛，名单递交截止日期11月30日。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">(2) 在场聆听全部歌曲的出彩部分（没有上交出彩部分的作品，则从头开始播放至30s）。歌曲播放顺序由各班代表抽签决定。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">(3) 聆听完毕后进行投票。每人拥有3票，每人不可重复投给同一首歌曲。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">(4) 投票完毕后当场计票，产生前10名，第1名为最佳人气奖</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">(5) 投票时间暂定12月2日中午12:30 ，地点为阶梯教室4104</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">第二次评选：专业点评</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">(1)由专业老师评委进行打分评选</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">(2)产生大赛得分前三名，第一名获得最佳原创奖</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">(3)产生优秀原创奖1名（全原创歌曲）</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">3、展示方式</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">(1) 由大众公投产生的前10名经作者同意后放入校园课间歌单，同时展出歌曲海报。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">(2) 由专业点评产生的前三名及最佳人气奖在艺术节闭幕式暨文艺汇演上现场演唱。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">活动中第（四）项，各班必须选送</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">1——2个参加评比。</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> </span></strong></p><p style="line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（五）美术类比赛细则</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">美育实践活动一：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">2023年兔年月历设计与制作</span></span></strong></p><p style="line-height: 150%;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">2023年是农历癸卯兔年。高一、高二年段以班级为单</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">位设计《月历</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">·2023年》</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">主题：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“玉兔迎春至，一中报喜来”。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">格式要求：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">4K大小(389mm*546mm</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">)，竖式排版；手绘、拼贴均可；图像部分大小为整张纸的一半；</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">内容要求：农历年月日、阳历年月日、节日标注等。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">画风要求：绘画材料不限，平面立体不限。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">上交时间：截止</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">2022年12月8日</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">上交地址：树兰楼（行政楼四楼）</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">4016</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">联系电话：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">18906858106</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">展览评比</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">按照分数分为一、二、三等奖若干。</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">高一、高二各班级提交月份牌月份内容限定：</span></span></p><p>
</p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2022/11/202211181357406980.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202211181357406980.png" /></p><p>
</p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2022/11/202211181358486126.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202211181358486126.png" /></p><p>
</p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">美育实践活动二：艺术节舞台展演舞美、灯光、化妆、道具设计及制作比赛</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">现场评比</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">按照分数分为一、二、三等奖若干。</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">美育实践活动三：摄影比赛</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">内容：以</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“光影雅集 魅力绍中”为主线，从城乡文化，到学生生活，把我们的视角延伸到学校内外，通过影像感受到新时代身边的变化和生活的美好。</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">提交：数码照片</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">上交时间：截止</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">2022年12月8日</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">上交地址：公共文件夹</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">\音美劳\舒凤</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">联系电话：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">17757528795</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">评比</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">按照分数分为一、二、三等奖若干。</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（六）闭幕式暨迎新春文艺会演</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">时间：暂定</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">12月10日分高一、高二两场进行（具体时间另行通知）</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">地点：图书馆三楼报告厅一。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-weight: bold;font-size: 16px">四、</span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">奖励办法：</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312"> 艺术节设优秀组织奖、优秀节目奖若干名。各类比赛分设一、二、三等奖若干名。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:right;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">                                                                     </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px">  <span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">2022年11月1</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">8</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">日</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:right;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">                                                                        德育处、艺术组</span></span></p><p>
</p>
    
